notes.content:
We follow your feedback and see all the shortcomings of the game and we try to improve it to the best of our ability to do so.

The game has undergone the following changes:
[list]
[*] The yellow butterfly on the second level has been lightened;
[*] Platformer element has been lightened significantly;
[*] Changed Michelle's locations in the first location;
[*] Fixed pause that could disappear;
[*] Control prompts are now separate for keyboard and gamepad;
[*] Fixed control switching;
[*] Enlarged butterfly collider for easier catching;
[*] Fixed some holes which caused possible saves to be lost;
[/list]

Sincerely,
Dev Team 🐺🐾

We are still working on improving the game and here are the following changes:

[list]
[*] Visually modified some parts of the locations;
[*] Added new music;
[*] Completely redesigned wolf control;
[*] Optimization work has been carried out on some locations;
[*] Fixed music overlay;
[/list]

Sincerely,
Dev Team 🐺🐾

As promised before, we are still working on game improvements.
And this is what we have in this update :3

[list]
[*] Reworked final game cutscene;
[*] Added multiple ending (depends on how much you will help Michele);
[*] World environment improved (looks better and more optimized);
[*] Added new sounds to mini-games and puzzles;
[*] Wolfe's movement improved;
[*] Improved player's navigation at levels;
[*] Improved wolfe's animations;
[*] Improved UI;
[*] Fixed bugs with main menu;
[*] Major bugs fixed;
[/list]

Sincerely,
Dev Team 🐺🐾

We will keep improving the game and this is what we have in new update:
[list]
[*] Animations improved;
[*] Model texture are more detailed;
[*] 5th level redesigned;
[*] First minigame improved UX;
[*] Reduced game size from 3.9gb to 2.5gb;
[*] Second ending is improved; 
[*] Wolf steering improved;
[/list]

Sincerely,
Dev Team 🐺🐾
